      ('Universal Business Language 2.3','OASIS','https://docs.oasis-open.org/ubl/os-UBL-2.3/UBL-2.3.html','OASIS Standard UBL 2.3','standard','Selected process-dependent party roles and distinct payee; full XSD and conformance not checked.'),
      ('Cybersecurity Supply Chain Risk Management Practices','NIST','https://nvlpubs.nist.gov/nistpubs/SpecialPublications/NIST.SP.800-161r1-upd1.pdf','May 2022; updated November 1, 2024','standard','Selected 1.5.2 and SR-6 assessment context; C-SCRM guidance, not universal supplier law or exclusion authority.'),
      ('Prospective Suppliers','Oracle','https://docs.oracle.com/en/cloud/saas/procurement/25c/oaprc/prospective-suppliers.html','Fusion Procurement 25c','first-party-doc','Selected prospective versus spend-authorization semantics illustrate scoped approval, not a universal two-state lifecycle.'),
